# Project Overview

- This is a SaaS platform for Point of Sale both internal and customer facing tools
- There is a POS, a Kiosk, a Web App, and a Mobile App all built with Flutter
- There is a Portal / Backoffice and a C# backend

---

# Architecture Overview

- Flutter implements some custom Clean Architecture approach using riverpod for state management
- Build runner is heavily used for code generation

---

# Git Standards

- All projects use conventional commits, if you are asked to commit anything, use the `commit` skill which explains how to perform correctly styled commits
